    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 14 Greenlea Place to the market. A spacious duplex end property situated in this small exclusive gated development off Terenure Road West and within minutes of Terenure Village with its wide selection of shops, restaurants, cafes, beside bus routes, schools, and Bushy Park. \r\n\r\nLandscaped development with communal garden and parking offering a rare combination of tranquillity and convenience. Upgraded throughout and tastefully presented, full of light with excellent layout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of lounge with open fireplace and doors to large south-facing balcony. Kitchen with a range of units, 2 double bedrooms and bathroom. Outside is parking and a communal garden.\r\n\r\nA particular highlight is the large balcony, which captures sunshine throughout the day and provides an ideal space for relaxation or entertaining. \r\n\r\nTerenure offers the best of both worlds – a vibrant village atmosphere with every convenience on hand, combined with excellent connectivity to the city. The area is renowned for its superb choice of cafés, restaurants and independent shops as well as excellent schools and sporting clubs with gyms, yoga studios and more all within a 5 min walk of this development. Bushy Park provides wonderful green space for walks, its famous Saturday market and outdoor activities, while excellent bus routes (bus stop 1 min away to city)  and easy access to the M50 make commuting effortless. Altogether, Terenure is a highly sought-after location, offering a welcoming community feel within minutes of Dublin city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Lounge \r\nSolid fuel stove, marble hearth. Tiled floor, recessed lights, door to balcony, understairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining\r\nRange of units, sink unit, extractor, recessed lights. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1\r\nSliderobes.\r\nBedroom 2\r\nSliderobes.\r\nShowerroom\r\nRainfall and electric telephone shower, W.C., WHB. Tiled. Medicine cupboards, fitted unit.\r\nBalcony. \r\nTiled. \r\nCommunal garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nFirst floor \r\nSouth-facing balcony\r\nGated development\r\nParking\r\nPrivate development low density\r\nTurn key condition\r\nManagement Fee €1650\r\nQuiet, highly regarded development\r\nBeside Terenure village, bus routes, Bushy Park.\r\nConvenient to M50 and city centre."
      },
      {
